@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Login

actor "Mahasiswa/Dosen" as User
participant "Frontend" as App
participant "Backend" as System
database "Database" as DB

User -> App : Input username & password
App -> System : Kirim data login

System -> DB : Validasi akun
DB --> System : Data pengguna

alt Login berhasil
    System --> App : Status berhasil
    App --> User : Masuk ke dashboard
else Login gagal
    System --> App : Status gagal
    App --> User : Tampilkan pesan error
end

@enduml